<section class="manifesto" id="manifesto" data-manifesto aria-labelledby="manifesto-title">
  <div class="manifesto__sticky">
    <span class="manifesto__ghost" data-manifesto-ghost aria-hidden="true">01</span>
    <span class="manifesto__glow" data-manifesto-glow aria-hidden="true"></span>

    <div class="manifesto__inner shell">
      <header class="manifesto__head">
        <p class="bracket-label">engineering principles</p>
        <p class="manifesto__count"><span data-manifesto-count>01</span><span> / 03</span></p>
      </header>

      <h2 id="manifesto-title" class="visually-hidden">工程原则</h2>

      <div class="manifesto__lines">
        <p data-manifesto-line>状态只留一个 owner，<br class="manifesto__br" /><em>其余组件订阅它</em>。</p>
        <p data-manifesto-line>先把失败路径写完，<br class="manifesto__br" /><em>再写成功路径</em>。</p>
        <p data-manifesto-line>没上过真机的改动，<br class="manifesto__br" /><em>一律算没做完</em>。</p>
      </div>

      <footer class="manifesto__foot">
        <span>reproduce / fix / verify</span>
        <div class="manifesto__progress" aria-hidden="true"><i data-manifesto-fill></i></div>
        <span>scroll to read</span>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
